<h1 id="ecommerce">Selling products and accepting payments (e-commerce) with <strong class="text-gradient">ZeroPoint</strong></h1>

<p class="lead">Any platform with a product API can be your store's CMS. Fetch your catalog at build time, generate static product pages, and let the platform host the checkout. No database, no server, no runtime — just durable HTML.</p>
<p class="lead">Your products live in the platform you choose. Every time your site builds, ZeroPoint fetches the latest data and regenerates your store automatically.</p>

<h2 id="example-platforms">Example platforms</h2>
<p>The principles below apply to any e-commerce platform with a product API and hosted checkout. Here are two popular options that work great with ZeroPoint:</p>
