<h2>Both follow the same pattern</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Create products in the platform's dashboard</li>
  <li><code>src/data/[platform].js</code> fetches your catalog at build time</li>
  <li>A store listing page at <code>/store/</code> loops over the data</li>
  <li>Individual product pages at <code>/store/product-name/</code> are generated via <a href="https://www.11ty.dev/docs/pagination/">pagination</a></li>
  <li>The "Buy Now" button links to the platform's hosted checkout — no payment data touches your site</li>
</ol>

